Jobs Vandenberg SFB, CA Jobs Virginia Beach, VA Jobs WA, Joint Base Lewis- McChord (JBLM) Jobs Waldorf, MD Jobs Washington DC Jobs Advanced Job Search Talent Network As a global, online university and technology pioneer, UMGC offers exceptional careers to professionals in a wide range of fields. The university offers an array of career options, along with ample opportunities for growth and advancement. Explore the broad range of faculty and staff positions and become a member of the UMGC community. Advisors As part of our world-class enrollment management team, you’ll enjoy: An extraordinary opportunity for new graduates Extensive training and mentoring program Strong foundational salary and benefits package, including tuition remission A focus on quality — and on playing an active role in helping people build a better future Professional Support & Services Regardless of your area of interest, we're creating a new standard for what you should expect from your career. As a global, online university and technology pioneer, UMGC offers exceptional career opportunities in a wide range of fields, including Marketing, Financial Aid, Finance, Administration and much more, all featuring: Collaborative, cross-functional teams comprised of experts from diverse backgrounds Opportunities to see your work implemented on a global scale Excellent benefits, including tuition remission, and a variety of retirement options If you have the creativity and optimism to embrace change and shape the next generation of online learning, UMGC is the only place to be. UMGC Careers. Never Stop Learning. Join Our Talent Community Recognized worldwide as a pioneer in online education, UMGC is in the process of transforming the field yet again by empowering extraordinary people to build extraordinary careers. Sign Up Now All external hires will be subject to the satisfactory completion of a pre-employment background review. This includes, but is not limited to, employment and education verification and criminal records check. Certain designated jobs are subject to a pre-employment assessment. We are an affirmative action and equal opportunity employer. Annual Safety and Security Report (opens in a new window) © University of Maryland Global Campus. All rights reserved. Mailing Address No classes or services at this location 3501 University Blvd. East, Adelphi, MD   20783 Get Social (opens in a new window)"
