t Employee in Largo, MD Follow UMGC on Social Media All external hires will be subject to the satisfactory completion of a pre-employment background review. This includes, but is not limited to, employment and education verification and criminal records check. Certain designated jobs are subject to a pre-employment assessment. We are an affirmative action and equal opportunity employer. Annual Safety and Security Report (opens in a new window) © University of Maryland Global Campus. All rights reserved. Mailing Address No classes or services at this location 3501 University Blvd. East, Adelphi, MD   20783 Get Social (opens in a new window)"
