ent. We are an affirmative action and equal opportunity employer. Annual Safety and Security Report (opens in a new window) © University of Maryland Global Campus. All rights reserved. Mailing Address No classes or services at this location 3501 University Blvd. East, Adelphi, MD   20783 Get Social (opens in a new window)"
