      "description": "UMGC Careers (@UMGCCareers) / X Log in Sign up UMGC Careers 18K posts UMGC Careers @UMGCCareers University of Maryland Global Campus is not just a great place to learn…it’s also a great place to work. Adelphi, MD careers.umgc.edu Joined November 2009 470 Following 1,515 Followers Mention Follow Posts Posts Replies Replies Reposts Reposts Media Media Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Terms · Privacy · Cookies · Accessibility · US TIDA · Ads Info · More © 2026 X Corp. UMGC Careers @UMGCCareers Jun 30, 2025 This account is no longer active. Please follow @ umdglobalcampus for all things UMGC! 134 UMGC Careers @UMGCCareers Mar 8, 2025 Celebrating the strength, resilience, and beauty of every woman worldwide! Happy International Women's Day! #InternationalWomensDay 1 109 UMGC Careers @UMGCCareers Mar 5, 2025 Experience the brilliance of Maryland's youthful artists at the High School Juried Art Exhibition hosted by the UMGC Arts Program. Take a journey through this rich showcase open until April 6th at the College Park Marriott Hotel & Conference Center. 🎨 #ArtisticWeekend #UMGCArts Show more 66 UMGC Careers @UMGCCareers Mar 3, 2025 🎉🎂 Happy Birthday to the @ navy_reserve ! 🎂🎉\n\nToday, we celebrate the dedication, courage, and service of our Navy Reserve members who have proudly served our country for years. 🇺🇸⚓ Thank you for your commitment and sacrifices at home and abroad. Here's to many more years of Show more 48 UMGC Careers @UMGCCareers Feb 28, 2025 Wishing everyone a Happy Ramadan. 1 56"
